msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because I didn’t think telling him,⟪k:3⟫“I know the future, and I need your help "
"to change it,”⟪k:4⟫would have gone over very well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Porque eu não acho que dizer para ele, ⟪k:3⟫“Eu sei o futuro e preciso de sua "
"ajuda para mudá-lo,”⟪k:4⟫teria dado muito certo."

