#: scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07cf780daf49862268abe672ff0cc342abed676c38854237e97aa658f5b30c28
#. default-sha256: 1117eb4195cfd5fc6a524758c86c608722db63cba350c22467bf5b5abae3b73f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I was always the one with nothing to offer,⟪k:2⟫powerless to be of anyone’s help...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Eu sempre fui aquele sem nada para oferecer,⟪k:2⟫impotente para ajudar a ninguém...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
