msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So if anything’s motivating me,⟪k:1⟫it’s not concern for the boy,)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Então, se algo está me motivando,⟪k:1⟫não é preocupação com o menino,)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80c5caff63424bfbd0e5a320fb74170179156bd8dea2c62729d9ec0cebbef72b
#. default-sha256: b0e3a1301917bc01bfc9fa145dacbfe7ec1238dddce5dd53f1caf5dbf93fa70b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t take much arm-twisting to get him to give us a room, so who knows, maybe "
"he’ll come over to our side easier than either of us expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não foi preciso muita pressão para que nos desse um quarto, então quem sabe, "
"talvez ele venha para o nosso lado mais fácil do que nós esperamos."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b336409f22cb2f8c555c79bc00b71f2202b61fc690bac1eb6a2ec0a6d8e55a7
#. default-sha256: 49e03d7595df81b572f0bef756d519d136169842483023de3ffda7a13221498e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He doesn’t trust me, but he also doesn’t know enough about me to decide what to do "
"yet. ⟪k:3⟫He needs time, and doing this gives him that time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele não confia em mim, mas ainda não sabe o suficiente sobre mim para decidir o "
"que fazer. ⟪k:3⟫Precisa de tempo, e fazer isso dá a ele esse tempo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35acd07f25c562188013460f302254b5df88524d60b9707422bb358624c90092
