msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he decides keeping me around is not to his advantage, he will act accordingly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se ele decidir que me manter por perto não é vantajoso, agirá de acordo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a261ed726aeb73f429911c1c5bc08bb4ef723f0911f9c7f12d7234fa4cab3f84
