msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Talvez... ⟪k:3⟫Talvez eu tenha.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Mas na época que Hayden Rhodes faleceu..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 187328ac3027cfa357bd0b151aef2dffad075d06f18b4e82d37cc3d98dede87f
#. default-sha256: d41be4cd976c275d638c29d943137ac9f43b9c2af028b9db3efc9abd289927bd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu tinha me tornado... ⟪k:3⟫apenas outra parte da mansão amaldiçoada."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea2d4beba88dcf7b3ee09cbe9323a0ea3f83fd2f4a408a8103492038e1e827a8
#. default-sha256: 869b3aad39e9b263258bdc5e764e2b3dd2f8d94d155db00b59b936ed042307c4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Suponho que, assim como as regras diferem entre o reino dos vivos e dos mortos, ⟪k:1⟫elas "
"também diferem para aqueles que perderam o controle da realidade.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8041827d82a97250e68ce2b67f94b993ccda3a75fdf65327fb100775b016bf3a
#. default-sha256: ae071468040291ded0c5daecd9157e5b41ff496425da0274137fa26302cdebd3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Outra pessoa está segurando as rédeas.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Meu primeiro palpite seria o lorde, mas "
"independentemente..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43e5e7533ac0e21958977097c8d9c3af6ce5dfa9dc2649db0179642419af72f2
#. default-sha256: 69235fa738e64f3c9ab6f7616a2c06cd40fbe0c110e74224089dde562e17e8a3
