msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫eles não são iguais nesta empreitada."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 117069b31d8bd418eb1eeccd2d56d153ce89e1b03a9ecaccf7e2702c8b94acdc
#. default-sha256: e2b077a9db8bbcd42c4540f5f8c5490918a1126e801dc68a9f6345c7144b07be
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se ele quer sair, talvez tivesse concordado em ajudar se dissessemos que estamos "
"aqui para salvar Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 878052cb332b0292550560dfc5472e04c1965a41f9853b252d0cab9124c0c3dc
#. default-sha256: 89ad676d364c42110afd722f189d9b258734f25eb5f5f7a391398e2a937ac6c1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você está certo, nós podemos.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sabemos coisas que não deveríamos ter como "
"saber."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 352b9fba228dac7b118e9efe2cf3c11dc5c2729a64d54f57a2f600c2f2dc0e38
#. default-sha256: 8a26284811951baebf96caa046373157e36254ed859c6232d20f1c9cd8458a40
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cada um deles tem suas razões para trancar Morgana,⟪k:3⟫e se eu estiver certa, "
"eles estão fazendo isso por outras pessoas.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫São esses poderosos laços que os conduzem."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62a6c196fedbaa7a344b2357b2547c9f774e0a7372941a89a0ca4bc2756669c5
#. default-sha256: 3af4f92cbeb81777c69019ee6cd83c442c62498d192fb1abe7b05a7005c8f33b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(São eles meros laços, ou é o destino que os une?)"

